@startuml state-swap-request
!include style.iuml
hide empty description

state AwaitingCounterpart : entry / notify counterpart
state AwaitingSupervisor : entry / add to supervisor queue
state Approved : entry / reassign both slots
state Approved : entry / notify both workers
state Declined : entry / notify requester
state Denied : entry / notify both workers
state Canceled : entry / notify other party
state Stale : entry / notify both workers

[*] --> AwaitingCounterpart : openSwap [both slots owned and unlocked]

AwaitingCounterpart --> AwaitingSupervisor : accept [same week and not yet started]
AwaitingCounterpart --> Declined : decline
AwaitingCounterpart --> Canceled : cancel [by requester]
AwaitingCounterpart --> Stale : scheduleChanged [a slot was edited or locked]

AwaitingSupervisor --> Approved : approve [neither worker exceeds weekly hour cap]
AwaitingSupervisor --> Denied : deny
AwaitingSupervisor --> Denied : approve [a worker would exceed weekly hour cap]
AwaitingSupervisor --> Canceled : cancel [by either worker]
AwaitingSupervisor --> Stale : scheduleChanged [a slot was edited or locked]

Approved --> [*]
Declined --> [*]
Denied --> [*]
Canceled --> [*]
Stale --> [*]
@enduml
